Bundled data (src/linkit_all/data/, built by scripts/build_datasets.py):
  - Countries and cities (countries.json, cities.json): derived from GeoNames
    (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Data was filtered, renamed and compacted;
    Arabic names were picked from GeoNames alternate names or written by hand.
  - Job titles (titles.json): This product includes information from the O*NET(R) Database by
    the U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration (USDOL/ETA). Used
    under the CC BY 4.0 license. O*NET(R) is a trademark of USDOL/ETA. LinKit All has modified
    all or some of this information (titles were merged, deduplicated and trimmed). USDOL/ETA
    has not approved, endorsed, or tested these modifications.
  - Arabic and English personal names (name_pairs.json): "Uses arabnamer's Arabic name dictionary
    (Yousef, E., 2026). https://github.com/sayedyousef/arabnamer. Licensed under CC-BY-4.0."
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Copied unchanged from arabnamer 0.1.3.
  - Exchange rates (fx.json, refreshed at the start of each search from
    https://open.er-api.com/v6/latest/USD): Rates By Exchange Rate API
    (https://www.exchangerate-api.com).
